@startuml
skinparam conditionStyle diamond
skinparam ConditionEndStyle diamond
skinparam ActivityDiamondFontSize 11

|Warehouse Robot|
start
:Report actual quantities collected for sub-order;
|System|
:Reduce physical stock by confirmed picked quantities;
:Release matching reservations;
if (All products picked?) then ([yes])
else ([no])
  :Set missing order lines to backorder;
endif
if (All sub-orders finished?) then ([yes])
  :Update actual order status;
else ([no])
endif
|Warehouse Robot|
:Request next sub-order for its own aisle;
|System|
if (Pending sub-order for this aisle?) then ([yes])
  :Return next sub-order;
else ([no])
  :Return no available work;
endif
stop
@enduml
